{% comment %}
  Credibility band: a claim, the argument for it, and the logos that back it.

  It replaced two sections on About -- the success-story dollar figures and the
  "Where We're Headed" vision block. About sells the company's reputation, not
  individual paychecks; earnings figures belong on the pages that sell a
  certification. The one durable point from the vision block, NCCA
  accreditation, is folded into the lead here.

  NCCA WORDING IS SETTLED, and not to be raised again: the copy is Chris's own
  and already live on the site.

  It is also defensible on its own terms -- the process is described as in
  progress, with no timeline and no promised outcome. Keep it that way if the
  copy is ever edited.

  THE LOGO ROW is snippets/suf-gymline.liquid, shared with the homepage proof
  band. Same blocks, same case statement; only the surface differs.

  ELEMENT. The root is a <div>: `"tag": "section"` already wraps this.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="suf-section suf-standard" {% if section.settings.anchor != blank %}id="{{ section.settings.anchor | handle }}"{% endif %}>
  <div class="suf-wrap">
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
      <div class="suf-section__head">
        <h2>{% render 'suf-nb', text: section.settings.heading %}</h2>
        {%- comment -%}
          Escaped BEFORE suf-nb: these are plain `text` settings and suf-nb
          inserts markup, so escaping afterwards would escape its own spans
          back into visible text.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.aside != blank -%}
          {%- assign aside = section.settings.aside | escape -%}
          <p class="suf-section__aside">{% render 'suf-nb', text: aside %}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if section.settings.lead != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        A <div>, not a <p>: a richtext setting emits its own <p>, and nesting
        one inside another is invalid -- the browser auto-closes the outer
        element and the content escapes the styled wrapper.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="suf-standard__lead">{% render 'suf-nb', text: section.settings.lead %}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- render 'suf-gymline', blocks: section.blocks, label: section.settings.gymline_label -%}

    {%- if section.settings.note != blank -%}
      {%- assign note = section.settings.note | escape -%}
      <p class="suf-gymnote suf-gymnote--light">{% render 'suf-nb', text: note %}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Credibility band (SUF)",
  "tag": "section",
  "max_blocks": 8,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "heading", "label": "Section heading" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "aside",
      "label": "Supporting note",
      "info": "Sits right-aligned beside the heading."
    },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "lead", "label": "Lead paragraph" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "anchor", "label": "Anchor id" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Logo row" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "gymline_label",
      "label": "Row label",
      "info": "e.g. \"Our graduates train at\"."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "note",
      "label": "Note under the row"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "logo",
      "name": "Gym logo",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "logo",
          "label": "Gym",
          "info": "Adding a gym needs an SVG asset and a case in snippets/suf-gymline.liquid.",
          "options": [
            { "value": "lifetime", "label": "Life Time" },
            { "value": "equinox", "label": "Equinox" },
            { "value": "genesis", "label": "Genesis" }
          ],
          "default": "lifetime"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "label",
          "label": "Accessible name",
          "info": "Read aloud in place of the logo."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "badge",
      "name": "Text badge",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "info": "For a destination with no logo. Line breaks are preserved."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Credibility band (SUF)",
      "blocks": [{ "type": "logo" }, { "type": "logo" }, { "type": "badge" }]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
